MOBILETIMERD(8)             System Manager's Manual            MOBILETIMERD(8)

NAME
     mobiletimerd – timer agent

SYNOPSIS
     takes no arguments, and users should not launch it manually.

DESCRIPTION
     It manages alarms and timers, and is responsible for showing
     notifications when they fire.

HISTORY
     mobiletimerd first appeared in macOS 13.

